{"resourceIdentifier":"5431","resourceName":"Baoshan East Hope Swine Farm AWMS GHG Mitigation Project","description":"Baoshan East Hope Swine Farm AWMS GHG Mitigation Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) applies one animal waste management system (AWMS i.e. Enclosed Anaerobic Digester, the same below) to treat the manure from the swine farm in Baoshan City, Yunnan Province, which is owned by Baoshan East Hope Animal Husbandry Co., Ltd (hereinafter called the project owner). The purpose of the project activity is to treat the manure and wastewater to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons.\r\nThis project is expected to generate approximately 6.04*104 m3 of biogas per year. This biogas will be collected and utilized for power generation. The electricity generated will only be used for the daily operation of AWMS and will not be provided to other users. For the sake of conservatism, the baseline emissions from electricity generation have been ignored.\r\nThe project activity will reduce GHG emissions in the atmosphere by avoiding methane emissions from anaerobic treatment of swine manure and wastewater. It is expected to achieve an annual emission reduction of 75,479 tCO2e and a total emission reduction of 754,790 tCO2e during the fixed 10-year crediting period.","location":{"latitude":24.937500,"longitude":99.275553},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-05-21","endExclusive":"2025-06-21","endInclusive":"2025-06-20"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5431"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Yun nan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Baoshan East Hope Animal Husbandry Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Yunnan Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"0875-8998608"},{"type":"string","value":"tianzx186@easthope.cn"},{"type":"string","value":"www.easthope.cn"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"49328"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0010"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"11/02/2026"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 25/08/2023 - 24/08/2033"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=126501&IDKEY=3iquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkf9174444879","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"BaoshanVCS--5431-Project-Description-v4.4.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-01-25T02:01:30.013Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=131992&IDKEY=eiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkff182016968","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS PD Project 5431-Undate.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-05-19T12:27:49.59Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=131991&IDKEY=s8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0n182015589","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Listing_Representation_Project5431-Updated.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-05-19T12:23:19.59Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=145632&IDKEY=m097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn878200826528","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS PD 5431 15012026_cl